<title>USA: Columbus Southern to redeem preferred.</title>
<headline>Columbus Southern to redeem preferred.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Columbus Southern Power Co said it will redeem all 500,000 shares of its 7-7/8 preferred cumulative preferred ($100 par value) on March 1.</p>
<p>Columbus Southern, a subsidiary of American Electric Power Co, said the preferred will be redeemed at $105.25 per share plus an amount computed at the annual dividend rate from February 1 to the date of redemption.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
